    {
      "$id": 21,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 0"
    },
    {
      "$id": 22,
      "style": 89,
      "name": "Let's start by building some houses.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to invite people who might[XENO:n ]\nwant to move to this town."
    },
    {
      "$id": 23,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 1"
    },
    {
      "$id": 24,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "You'll be able to invite even more people.[XENO:n ]\nWe need plenty of people to bring this[XENO:n ]\ntown to life, after all."
    },
    {
      "$id": 25,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 2"
    },
    {
      "$id": 26,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "Houses will be built along the main street.[XENO:n ]\nWith more people moving here, I bet[XENO:n ]\nall sorts of stories will unfold."
    },
    {
      "$id": 27,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 3"
    },
    {
      "$id": 28,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "Houses will be built near the main gate.[XENO:n ]\nWe'll also be able to build Nopon homes.[XENO:n ]\nThings should get lively in no time."
    },
    {
      "$id": 29,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 4"
    },
    {
      "$id": 30,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build lots of houses.[XENO:n ]\nI think people of various races will[XENO:n ]\ncome to live here."
    },
    {
      "$id": 31,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Housing - Lv 5"
    },
    {
      "$id": 32,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We can't fit any more houses here.[XENO:n ]\nGiven the size of the town, this is the limit.[XENO:n ]\nI'm sorry."
    },
    {
      "$id": 33,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 0"
    },
    {
      "$id": 34,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build shops.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to go shopping.[XENO:n ]\nI think they'll sell things exclusive to this town, too."
    },
    {
      "$id": 35,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 1"
    },
    {
      "$id": 36,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build shops opposite Reconstruction HQ.[XENO:n ]\nWith more shops, perhaps more people[XENO:n ]\nwill want to move here."
    },
    {
      "$id": 37,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 2"
    },
    {
      "$id": 38,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build lots of stalls along the main street.[XENO:n ]\nI'm sure it'll be a lively street[XENO:n ]\nboth day and night."
    },
    {
      "$id": 39,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 3"
    },
    {
      "$id": 40,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build stalls and shops near the main gate.[XENO:n ]\nI think it'll get lively in no time."
    },
    {
      "$id": 41,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 4"
    },
    {
      "$id": 42,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build lots of shops.[XENO:n ]\nI think they'll sell powerful weapons and armour."
    },
    {
      "$id": 43,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Commerce - Lv 5"
    },
    {
      "$id": 44,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We can't add any more shops.[XENO:n ]\nWe've got a bit of everything now.[XENO:n ]\nIt's plenty for living here."
    },
    {
      "$id": 45,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 0"
    },
    {
      "$id": 46,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll plant greenery. It'll be soothing.[XENO:n ]\nAt Nature Lv 3, ether crystals from the Ether Mine[XENO:n ]\nand elsewhere will increase in rank."
    },
    {
      "$id": 47,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 1"
    },
    {
      "$id": 48,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll make flower beds to brighten up the town.[XENO:n ]\nAt level 3, the rank of ether crystals you can[XENO:n ]\ngather at the Central Mine and elsewhere will rise."
    },
    {
      "$id": 49,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 2"
    },
    {
      "$id": 50,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll plant flowers on both sides of the main street.[XENO:n ]\nEther crystals from the Ether Mine and elsewhere[XENO:n ]\nwill increase in rank."
    },
    {
      "$id": 51,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 3"
    },
    {
      "$id": 52,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll make a tree-lined avenue. It'll be relaxing.[XENO:n ]\nEther crystals from the Ether Mine and elsewhere[XENO:n ]\nwill increase in rank."
    },
    {
      "$id": 53,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 4"
    },
    {
      "$id": 54,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll begin preparing for mining.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll find high-rank ether crystals[XENO:n ]\nat the Ether Mine and elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "$id": 55,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Nature - Lv 5"
    },
    {
      "$id": 56,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We can't add any more greenery.[XENO:n ]\nEther crystals at the Ether Mine and elsewhere[XENO:n ]\nare now high rank, so be sure to visit!"
    },
    {
      "$id": 57,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 0"
    },
    {
      "$id": 58,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build an assembly hall.[XENO:n ]\nI think everyone can use it to rest.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to pick up Collection Items."
    },
    {
      "$id": 59,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 1"
    },
    {
      "$id": 60,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build a farm.[XENO:n ]\nWe're planning to raise Armus there.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to pick up Collection Items."
    },
    {
      "$id": 61,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 2"
    },
    {
      "$id": 62,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build a park.[XENO:n ]\nIt'll be ideal for everyone to unwind.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to pick up Collection Items."
    },
    {
      "$id": 63,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 3"
    },
    {
      "$id": 64,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll build a watchtower.[XENO:n ]\nIt should feel wonderful up at the top.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to pick up Collection Items."
    },
    {
      "$id": 65,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 4"
    },
    {
      "$id": 66,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We'll reinforce Reconstruction HQ and build a base.[XENO:n ]\nThat'll make the town's defences solid.[XENO:n ]\nYou'll be able to pick up Collection Items."
    },
    {
      "$id": 67,
      "style": 11,
      "name": "Special - Lv 5"
    },
    {
      "$id": 68,
      "style": 147,
      "name": "We can't add anything else.[XENO:n ]\nWe've done everything we could think of."
    },
